oir 2 low
// Low golden of coro/async-repeated-await.oir (V4).
// future.lazy-and-cached: two awaits of one cache; the duty is saved across both.
// The three closes of main settle the duty version that reaches them; the final ones deliver (D18).
module async_repeated_await
entry @main
scope S0 action in @work
scope S1 action in @main
